<launch>
  <!-- SENSORS ONLY: the Livox Mid-360 driver, with no SLAM and no robot TF.

       Useful for checking the LiDAR on its own:
         roslaunch system_bringup sensors.launch
         rostopic hz /livox/lidar /livox/imu

       This is a thin pass-through to g1_slam, which owns the driver
       configuration (slam/config/mid360_config.json and the host-IP pitfall
       documented in CLAUDE.md). Nothing is duplicated here.

       The RealSense is NOT started here: perception/launch/perception.launch
       brings up the camera driver together with the perception node, so there
       is no camera-only launch interface to pass through to. Use
       system_bringup/manipulation.launch perception:=true for that.
  -->
  <include file="$(find g1_slam)/launch/sensors.launch"/>
</launch>
